# Self-hosted Switzer font files, fetched by scripts/fetch-fonts.mjs. This
# repo is public; the ITF Free Font Licence v2.0 (Section 02) permits
# self-hosting the files on Delta's own server but forbids redistributing
# them — and a public git repo is redistribution. `npm run build` (and
# `npm run fonts`) fetch them fresh into public/fonts/ instead.
public/fonts/

